{"id":"d259411e9c522740","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset.md","title":"ZFC Open Dense Subset","display":"df-zfc-open-dense-subset — ZFC Open Dense Subset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset"],"display":"df-zfc-open-dense-subset — ZFC Open Dense Subset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-open-dense-subset — ZFC Open Dense Subset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,P \\in V\">\\(D,P \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\;\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq_P\\;\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a> 的规范定义</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OpenDenseSubset}_S \\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{OpenDenseSubset}_S \\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}open\\text{-}dense\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OpenDenseSubset}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land D\\subseteq P\n\\land\\Bigl(\\forall p\\in D\\;\\forall q\\in P\\;(\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\;\\to q\\in D)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\Bigl(\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}open\\text{-}dense\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OpenDenseSubset}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land D\\subseteq P\n\\land\\Bigl(\\forall p\\in D\\;\\forall q\\in P\\;(\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\;\\to q\\in D)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\Bigl(\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在“较小即较强”的强迫约定下，open 表示向更强条件闭合，dense 表示每个条件都有属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 的加强。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)$ 采用 [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]] 的规范定义","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,P \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P\\;\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OpenDenseSubset}_S \\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}open\\text{-}dense\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OpenDenseSubset}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land D\\subseteq P\n\\land\\Bigl(\\forall p\\in D\\;\\forall q\\in P\\;(\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\;\\to q\\in D)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\Bigl(\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"D","display":false}],"bytes":1020,"backlinks":[{"id":"3bf4287c83498be0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OpenDenseSubset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset.md]])"},{"id":"e4c0a39a574d3382","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DenseOpenFamily}_S$ and $\\mathrm{OpenDenseSubset}_S$ are the predicates from [[58-df-zfc-dense-open-family]] and [[58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2841","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset.md|58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d3f859dbdd37f018"]}